{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":16,"title":"Divine and the demonic qualities","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Sonia","voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":617.424,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":50.208},{"title":"Lesson 1 · Two natures","start":395.16},{"title":"Lesson 2 · Denial of God and order","start":453.528},{"title":"Lesson 3 · Three gates","start":497.016},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Scripture as guide","start":544.92},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":591.432}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":3.168,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Sonia.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.526,"Welcome"],[0.682,0.145,"to"],[0.839,0.618,"Shruti"],[1.882,0.211,"I'm"],[2.105,0.658,"Sonia"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.456,"end":9.6,"text":"And I'm Brian. Today, Chapter Sixteen: the Divine and the Demonic Qualities.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.118,"And"],[0.197,0.184,"I'm"],[0.395,0.513,"Brian"],[1.329,0.5,"Today"],[1.842,0.461,"Chapter"],[2.316,0.789,"Sixteen"],[3.421,0.171,"the"],[3.605,0.605,"Divine"],[4.224,0.197,"and"],[4.434,0.105,"the"],[4.553,0.461,"Demonic"],[5.026,0.724,"Qualities"]]},{"s":"A","start":9.888,"end":23.496,"text":"This chapter is the Gita's character study. Two lists: the qualities that free us, and the ones that bind us. The second list has a portrait that is uncomfortably recognizable, even today.","L":[],"words":[[0.129,0.263,"This"],[0.405,0.579,"chapter"],[0.997,0.211,"is"],[1.221,0.132,"the"],[1.366,0.461,"Gita's"],[1.839,0.513,"character"],[2.366,0.474,"study"],[3.222,0.276,"Two"],[3.512,0.592,"lists"],[4.42,0.092,"the"],[4.525,0.618,"qualities"],[5.157,0.184,"that"],[5.354,0.289,"free"],[5.657,0.276,"us"],[6.143,0.092,"and"],[6.249,0.092,"the"],[6.354,0.355,"ones"],[6.722,0.171,"that"],[6.907,0.329,"bind"],[7.249,0.395,"us"],[8.066,0.118,"The"],[8.197,0.447,"second"],[8.658,0.395,"list"],[9.066,0.197,"has"],[9.276,0.079,"a"],[9.368,0.632,"portrait"],[10.013,0.184,"that"],[10.211,0.145,"is"],[10.368,0.803,"uncomfortably"],[11.184,0.974,"recognizable"],[12.382,0.25,"even"],[12.645,0.566,"today"]]},{"s":"B","start":23.784,"end":33.72,"text":"I like that you said recognizable. When I first read it, I kept thinking of people I know. And then, a little later, I kept thinking of myself.","L":[],"words":[[0.066,0.079,"I"],[0.158,0.289,"like"],[0.461,0.263,"that"],[0.737,0.105,"you"],[0.855,0.355,"said"],[1.224,1.026,"recognizable"],[2.658,0.118,"When"],[2.789,0.079,"I"],[2.882,0.395,"first"],[3.289,0.237,"read"],[3.539,0.197,"it"],[3.763,0.105,"I"],[3.882,0.25,"kept"],[4.145,0.329,"thinking"],[4.487,0.079,"of"],[4.579,0.342,"people"],[4.934,0.066,"I"],[5.013,0.395,"know"],[5.829,0.105,"And"],[5.947,0.289,"then"],[6.803,0.039,"a"],[6.855,0.276,"little"],[7.145,0.434,"later"],[8.145,0.066,"I"],[8.224,0.263,"kept"],[8.5,0.329,"thinking"],[8.842,0.066,"of"],[8.921,0.632,"myself"]]},{"s":"A","start":34.008,"end":40.296,"text":"That's exactly the right order, I think. Start with the neighbours, end with the mirror.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.289,"That's"],[0.445,0.566,"exactly"],[1.024,0.118,"the"],[1.155,0.329,"right"],[1.497,0.447,"order"],[2.155,0.132,"I"],[2.3,0.513,"think"],[3.237,0.474,"Start"],[3.724,0.145,"with"],[3.882,0.092,"the"],[3.987,0.605,"neighbours"],[4.868,0.263,"end"],[5.145,0.158,"with"],[5.316,0.092,"the"],[5.421,0.487,"mirror"]]},{"s":"B","start":40.584,"end":49.344,"text":"Four lessons today. But first, the story, such as it is, because this chapter is less a scene than a long, careful look in the mirror.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.145,"Four"],[0.237,0.539,"lessons"],[0.789,0.5,"today"],[1.697,0.132,"But"],[1.842,0.539,"first"],[2.395,0.118,"the"],[2.526,0.592,"story"],[3.132,0.303,"such"],[3.447,0.118,"as"],[3.579,0.092,"it"],[3.684,0.395,"is"],[4.342,0.316,"because"],[4.671,0.158,"this"],[4.842,0.513,"chapter"],[5.368,0.171,"is"],[5.553,0.25,"less"],[5.816,0.066,"a"],[5.895,0.461,"scene"],[6.368,0.132,"than"],[6.513,0.066,"a"],[6.592,0.408,"long"],[7.026,0.434,"careful"],[7.474,0.224,"look"],[7.711,0.092,"in"],[7.816,0.079,"the"],[7.908,0.461,"mirror"]]},{"s":"A","start":50.208,"end":65.496,"text":"Krishna begins with the divine qualities, sixteen point one to three: fearlessness, purity of heart, perseverance in Self-knowledge, charity, self-restraint, sacrifice, study of scripture, austerity, honesty.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.101,0.447,"Krishna"],[0.561,0.447,"begins"],[1.022,0.145,"with"],[1.18,0.105,"the"],[1.298,0.408,"divine"],[1.719,0.658,"qualities"],[2.653,0.487,"sixteen"],[3.153,0.263,"point"],[3.43,0.184,"one"],[3.627,0.092,"to"],[3.732,0.434,"three"],[4.509,0.803,"fearlessness"],[5.574,0.447,"purity"],[6.035,0.092,"of"],[6.14,0.461,"heart"],[6.877,0.789,"perseverance"],[7.68,0.132,"in"],[7.824,0.803,"Self-knowledge"],[8.89,0.618,"charity"],[9.824,0.855,"self-restraint"],[10.969,0.803,"sacrifice"],[12.048,0.342,"study"],[12.403,0.092,"of"],[12.509,0.566,"scripture"],[13.311,0.75,"austerity"],[14.311,0.579,"honesty"]]},{"s":"B","start":65.784,"end":81.768,"text":"Nonviolence, truthfulness, absence of anger, renunciation, calmness, abstaining from malicious talk, compassion for all creatures, freedom from greed, gentleness, modesty, steadiness.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.079,0.882,"Nonviolence"],[1.342,0.697,"truthfulness"],[2.566,0.447,"absence"],[3.026,0.079,"of"],[3.118,0.408,"anger"],[4.197,0.868,"renunciation"],[5.671,0.632,"calmness"],[6.842,0.553,"abstaining"],[7.408,0.158,"from"],[7.579,0.461,"malicious"],[8.053,0.382,"talk"],[8.974,0.592,"compassion"],[9.579,0.197,"for"],[9.789,0.184,"all"],[9.987,0.553,"creatures"],[11.118,0.368,"freedom"],[11.5,0.158,"from"],[11.671,0.434,"greed"],[12.645,0.684,"gentleness"],[13.737,0.632,"modesty"],[14.855,0.75,"steadiness"]]},{"s":"A","start":82.056,"end":95.4,"text":"Splendor, forgiveness, fortitude, cleanliness, absence of malice, and absence of pride. Our book counts twenty-six qualities. Notice the first one: fearlessness.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.724,"Splendor"],[1.116,0.75,"forgiveness"],[2.142,0.763,"fortitude"],[3.234,0.737,"cleanliness"],[4.274,0.434,"absence"],[4.721,0.118,"of"],[4.853,0.5,"malice"],[5.563,0.132,"and"],[5.708,0.513,"absence"],[6.234,0.118,"of"],[6.366,0.553,"pride"],[7.316,0.25,"Our"],[7.579,0.355,"book"],[7.947,0.474,"counts"],[8.434,0.671,"twenty-six"],[9.118,0.816,"qualities"],[10.342,0.526,"Notice"],[10.882,0.118,"the"],[11.013,0.408,"first"],[11.434,0.316,"one"],[12.053,0.908,"fearlessness"]]},{"s":"B","start":95.688,"end":101.136,"text":"Why fearlessness first, do you think? Of all the virtues, it leads the list.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.211,"Why"],[0.316,0.763,"fearlessness"],[1.092,0.5,"first"],[1.605,0.092,"do"],[1.711,0.079,"you"],[1.803,0.395,"think"],[2.618,0.171,"Of"],[2.803,0.237,"all"],[3.053,0.092,"the"],[3.158,0.645,"virtues"],[3.829,0.184,"it"],[4.026,0.329,"leads"],[4.368,0.132,"the"],[4.513,0.553,"list"]]},{"s":"A","start":101.424,"end":119.664,"text":"Remember where this whole conversation began. Arjuna, trembling on the battlefield, afraid of losing everyone he loves. Fear is what knocked him down in chapter one. So it makes a kind of sense that the very first mark of a divine nature is that fear no longer runs the show.","L":[],"words":[[0.129,0.579,"Remember"],[0.721,0.237,"where"],[0.971,0.224,"this"],[1.208,0.25,"whole"],[1.471,0.763,"conversation"],[2.247,0.566,"began"],[3.224,0.684,"Arjuna"],[4.184,0.461,"trembling"],[4.658,0.105,"on"],[4.776,0.079,"the"],[4.868,0.763,"battlefield"],[5.961,0.434,"afraid"],[6.408,0.105,"of"],[6.526,0.513,"losing"],[7.053,0.408,"everyone"],[7.474,0.132,"he"],[7.618,0.553,"loves"],[8.579,0.461,"Fear"],[9.053,0.184,"is"],[9.25,0.224,"what"],[9.487,0.289,"knocked"],[9.789,0.158,"him"],[9.961,0.368,"down"],[10.342,0.118,"in"],[10.474,0.408,"chapter"],[10.895,0.382,"one"],[11.671,0.224,"So"],[11.908,0.118,"it"],[12.039,0.25,"makes"],[12.303,0.053,"a"],[12.368,0.276,"kind"],[12.658,0.105,"of"],[12.776,0.447,"sense"],[13.237,0.158,"that"],[13.408,0.092,"the"],[13.513,0.316,"very"],[13.842,0.421,"first"],[14.276,0.316,"mark"],[14.605,0.105,"of"],[14.724,0.053,"a"],[14.789,0.421,"divine"],[15.224,0.526,"nature"],[15.763,0.158,"is"],[15.934,0.184,"that"],[16.132,0.316,"fear"],[16.461,0.158,"no"],[16.632,0.382,"longer"],[17.026,0.263,"runs"],[17.303,0.079,"the"],[17.395,0.447,"show"]]},{"s":"B","start":119.952,"end":133.416,"text":"And notice how practical the rest of the list is. Honesty, gentleness, not gossiping, not being fickle. These aren't mystical powers. They're the things your grandmother told you to do.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.132,"And"],[0.237,0.421,"notice"],[0.671,0.25,"how"],[0.934,0.645,"practical"],[1.592,0.092,"the"],[1.697,0.329,"rest"],[2.039,0.066,"of"],[2.118,0.105,"the"],[2.237,0.355,"list"],[2.605,0.382,"is"],[3.408,0.658,"Honesty"],[4.355,0.829,"gentleness"],[5.408,0.329,"not"],[5.75,0.711,"gossiping"],[6.842,0.303,"not"],[7.158,0.211,"being"],[7.382,0.513,"fickle"],[8.289,0.224,"These"],[8.526,0.382,"aren't"],[8.921,0.487,"mystical"],[9.421,0.697,"powers"],[10.526,0.211,"They're"],[10.75,0.132,"the"],[10.895,0.355,"things"],[11.263,0.158,"your"],[11.434,0.645,"grandmother"],[12.092,0.316,"told"],[12.421,0.105,"you"],[12.539,0.118,"to"],[12.671,0.408,"do"]]},{"s":"B","start":133.704,"end":144.792,"text":"Then the other list, sixteen point four, much shorter: hypocrisy, arrogance, pride, anger, harshness, and ignorance.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.092,0.118,"Then"],[0.224,0.092,"the"],[0.329,0.263,"other"],[0.605,0.382,"list"],[1.382,0.513,"sixteen"],[1.908,0.289,"point"],[2.211,0.329,"four"],[3.079,0.184,"much"],[3.276,0.434,"shorter"],[4.5,0.776,"hypocrisy"],[5.789,0.618,"arrogance"],[6.868,0.526,"pride"],[8.066,0.447,"anger"],[9.079,0.645,"harshness"],[9.882,0.197,"and"],[10.092,0.605,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"A","start":145.08,"end":158.232,"text":"Sixteen point five: divine qualities lead to liberation; the demonic ones to bondage. And then a lovely aside to Arjuna: do not grieve, Arjuna, you are born with divine qualities.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.142,0.579,"Sixteen"],[0.734,0.303,"point"],[1.05,0.526,"five"],[1.892,0.434,"divine"],[2.339,0.632,"qualities"],[2.984,0.276,"lead"],[3.274,0.105,"to"],[3.392,0.75,"liberation"],[4.445,0.105,"the"],[4.563,0.513,"demonic"],[5.089,0.329,"ones"],[5.432,0.118,"to"],[5.563,0.645,"bondage"],[6.605,0.145,"And"],[6.763,0.184,"then"],[6.961,0.053,"a"],[7.026,0.382,"lovely"],[7.421,0.434,"aside"],[7.868,0.118,"to"],[8.0,0.592,"Arjuna"],[8.908,0.132,"do"],[9.053,0.237,"not"],[9.303,0.447,"grieve"],[9.921,0.592,"Arjuna"],[10.829,0.105,"you"],[10.947,0.092,"are"],[11.053,0.342,"born"],[11.408,0.158,"with"],[11.579,0.395,"divine"],[11.987,0.776,"qualities"]]},{"s":"B","start":158.52,"end":164.904,"text":"Krishna noticed his friend getting worried, and reassured him. That's a teacher's kindness.","L":[],"words":[[0.079,0.368,"Krishna"],[0.461,0.447,"noticed"],[0.921,0.171,"his"],[1.105,0.408,"friend"],[1.526,0.263,"getting"],[1.803,0.5,"worried"],[2.829,0.263,"and"],[3.105,0.553,"reassured"],[3.671,0.329,"him"],[4.408,0.237,"That's"],[4.658,0.079,"a"],[4.75,0.487,"teacher's"],[5.25,0.737,"kindness"]]},{"s":"A","start":165.192,"end":179.136,"text":"It also tells us something about how to read the next part. Krishna isn't sorting people into heaven and hell from a distance. He's speaking to someone he loves, and he wants him to see clearly, not to despair.","L":[],"words":[[0.142,0.145,"It"],[0.3,0.382,"also"],[0.695,0.316,"tells"],[1.024,0.132,"us"],[1.168,0.487,"something"],[1.668,0.316,"about"],[1.997,0.184,"how"],[2.195,0.184,"to"],[2.392,0.303,"read"],[2.708,0.092,"the"],[2.813,0.342,"next"],[3.168,0.539,"part"],[4.09,0.618,"Krishna"],[4.722,0.316,"isn't"],[5.051,0.447,"sorting"],[5.511,0.461,"people"],[5.985,0.289,"into"],[6.287,0.421,"heaven"],[6.722,0.158,"and"],[6.893,0.342,"hell"],[7.248,0.197,"from"],[7.459,0.066,"a"],[7.537,0.737,"distance"],[8.697,0.184,"He's"],[8.895,0.5,"speaking"],[9.408,0.092,"to"],[9.513,0.355,"someone"],[9.882,0.118,"he"],[10.013,0.5,"loves"],[10.789,0.105,"and"],[10.908,0.105,"he"],[11.026,0.289,"wants"],[11.329,0.145,"him"],[11.487,0.105,"to"],[11.605,0.237,"see"],[11.855,0.539,"clearly"],[12.605,0.25,"not"],[12.868,0.092,"to"],[12.974,0.579,"despair"]]},{"s":"A","start":179.424,"end":189.144,"text":"Sixteen point six: there are basically two types of human beings in this world, the divine and the demonic. Now hear about the demonic.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.129,0.566,"Sixteen"],[0.708,0.289,"point"],[1.011,0.5,"six"],[1.839,0.105,"there"],[1.958,0.118,"are"],[2.089,0.632,"basically"],[2.734,0.263,"two"],[3.011,0.355,"types"],[3.379,0.079,"of"],[3.471,0.342,"human"],[3.826,0.382,"beings"],[4.221,0.105,"in"],[4.339,0.197,"this"],[4.55,0.408,"world"],[5.247,0.105,"the"],[5.366,0.579,"divine"],[6.05,0.132,"and"],[6.195,0.105,"the"],[6.313,0.724,"demonic"],[7.434,0.289,"Now"],[7.737,0.342,"hear"],[8.092,0.342,"about"],[8.447,0.105,"the"],[8.566,0.776,"demonic"]]},{"s":"B","start":189.432,"end":205.056,"text":"And the portrait begins, sixteen point seven and eight: they don't know what to do and what not to do. They have neither purity nor good conduct nor truthfulness. They say the world is unreal, without a basis, without God, without an order.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.092,0.132,"And"],[0.237,0.105,"the"],[0.355,0.461,"portrait"],[0.829,0.553,"begins"],[1.408,0.5,"sixteen"],[1.921,0.25,"point"],[2.184,0.382,"seven"],[2.579,0.145,"and"],[2.737,0.368,"eight"],[3.724,0.145,"they"],[3.882,0.184,"don't"],[4.079,0.158,"know"],[4.25,0.158,"what"],[4.421,0.092,"to"],[4.526,0.368,"do"],[4.908,0.132,"and"],[5.053,0.158,"what"],[5.224,0.224,"not"],[5.461,0.092,"to"],[5.566,0.368,"do"],[6.329,0.105,"They"],[6.447,0.211,"have"],[6.671,0.329,"neither"],[7.013,0.553,"purity"],[7.579,0.224,"nor"],[7.816,0.329,"good"],[8.158,0.579,"conduct"],[8.75,0.197,"nor"],[8.961,0.855,"truthfulness"],[10.211,0.105,"They"],[10.329,0.263,"say"],[10.605,0.105,"the"],[10.724,0.355,"world"],[11.092,0.145,"is"],[11.25,0.632,"unreal"],[11.908,0.368,"without"],[12.289,0.092,"a"],[12.395,0.605,"basis"],[13.026,0.421,"without"],[13.461,0.487,"God"],[14.197,0.434,"without"],[14.645,0.105,"an"],[14.763,0.461,"order"]]},{"s":"A","start":205.344,"end":217.776,"text":"Sixteen point ten and eleven: filled with insatiable desires, hypocrisy, pride and arrogance, obsessed with endless anxiety until death, convinced that sense pleasure is everything.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.129,0.579,"Sixteen"],[0.721,0.329,"point"],[1.063,0.237,"ten"],[1.313,0.105,"and"],[1.432,0.5,"eleven"],[2.261,0.342,"filled"],[2.616,0.158,"with"],[2.787,0.632,"insatiable"],[3.432,0.671,"desires"],[4.326,0.763,"hypocrisy"],[5.353,0.461,"pride"],[5.905,0.145,"and"],[6.063,0.671,"arrogance"],[7.024,0.474,"obsessed"],[7.511,0.132,"with"],[7.655,0.395,"endless"],[8.063,0.684,"anxiety"],[8.761,0.316,"until"],[9.089,0.421,"death"],[9.813,0.513,"convinced"],[10.339,0.158,"that"],[10.511,0.289,"sense"],[10.813,0.421,"pleasure"],[11.247,0.158,"is"],[11.418,0.632,"everything"]]},{"s":"B","start":218.064,"end":231.288,"text":"Sixteen point twelve fills in the motive. Bound by hundreds of ties of desire, enslaved by lust and anger, they strive to get wealth by unlawful means, just to feed their pleasures.","L":[],"words":[[0.092,0.539,"Sixteen"],[0.645,0.329,"point"],[0.987,0.355,"twelve"],[1.355,0.461,"fills"],[1.829,0.158,"in"],[2.0,0.079,"the"],[2.092,0.566,"motive"],[3.079,0.395,"Bound"],[3.487,0.158,"by"],[3.658,0.474,"hundreds"],[4.145,0.092,"of"],[4.25,0.355,"ties"],[4.618,0.079,"of"],[4.711,0.632,"desire"],[5.711,0.671,"enslaved"],[6.395,0.171,"by"],[6.579,0.461,"lust"],[7.053,0.118,"and"],[7.184,0.513,"anger"],[8.224,0.132,"they"],[8.368,0.487,"strive"],[8.868,0.092,"to"],[8.974,0.197,"get"],[9.184,0.368,"wealth"],[9.566,0.224,"by"],[9.803,0.592,"unlawful"],[10.408,0.5,"means"],[11.289,0.276,"just"],[11.579,0.079,"to"],[11.671,0.355,"feed"],[12.039,0.145,"their"],[12.197,0.645,"pleasures"]]},{"s":"A","start":231.576,"end":242.472,"text":"Hundreds of ties. That image stays with me. Not one big chain, but hundreds of little threads, each one a want, and together they hold you down completely.","L":[],"words":[[0.129,0.474,"Hundreds"],[0.616,0.132,"of"],[0.761,0.645,"ties"],[1.829,0.289,"That"],[2.132,0.395,"image"],[2.539,0.408,"stays"],[2.961,0.171,"with"],[3.145,0.316,"me"],[3.868,0.329,"Not"],[4.211,0.276,"one"],[4.5,0.211,"big"],[4.724,0.461,"chain"],[5.421,0.145,"but"],[5.579,0.447,"hundreds"],[6.039,0.105,"of"],[6.158,0.276,"little"],[6.447,0.526,"threads"],[7.211,0.197,"each"],[7.421,0.171,"one"],[7.605,0.039,"a"],[7.658,0.434,"want"],[8.395,0.079,"and"],[8.487,0.447,"together"],[8.947,0.118,"they"],[9.079,0.289,"hold"],[9.382,0.105,"you"],[9.5,0.289,"down"],[9.803,0.711,"completely"]]},{"s":"B","start":242.76,"end":270.216,"text":"And then the inner monologue, sixteen point thirteen to fifteen, which reads like it was written yesterday. This has been gained by me today. I shall fulfill this desire. I have this much wealth, and I'll have more. That enemy has been slain by me, and I shall slay others too. I am the lord. I am the enjoyer. I am successful, powerful and happy. I am rich and well-born. Who is equal to me?","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.092,0.105,"And"],[0.211,0.224,"then"],[0.447,0.066,"the"],[0.526,0.276,"inner"],[0.816,0.632,"monologue"],[1.461,0.526,"sixteen"],[2.0,0.263,"point"],[2.276,0.539,"thirteen"],[2.829,0.105,"to"],[2.947,0.711,"fifteen"],[3.947,0.276,"which"],[4.237,0.316,"reads"],[4.566,0.224,"like"],[4.803,0.079,"it"],[4.895,0.158,"was"],[5.066,0.224,"written"],[5.303,0.658,"yesterday"],[6.355,0.158,"This"],[6.526,0.158,"has"],[6.697,0.197,"been"],[6.908,0.434,"gained"],[7.355,0.171,"by"],[7.539,0.211,"me"],[7.763,0.526,"today"],[8.711,0.066,"I"],[8.789,0.25,"shall"],[9.053,0.553,"fulfill"],[9.618,0.211,"this"],[9.842,0.684,"desire"],[10.908,0.079,"I"],[11.0,0.211,"have"],[11.224,0.197,"this"],[11.434,